msgstr "통합 통화 및 녹화를 사용한 통화 배포"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-guide.md:209
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-guide.md:240
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-guide.md:260
msgid "**Mattermost server**: Calls plugin is pre-installed."
msgstr "**OKR.BEST 서버**: 통화 플러그인이 사전 설치되어 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-guide.md:210
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-guide.md:262
msgid ""
"**Calls Offloader**: Job service that manages recording, transcription "
"and live captions."
msgstr ""
"**Calls Offloader**: 녹화, 전사 및 실시간 자막을 관리하는 작업 서비스."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-guide.md:214
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-guide.md:245
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-guide.md:266
msgid "**Mattermost Enterprise** or **Enterprise Advanced**"
msgstr "**Mattermost Enterprise** 또는 **Enterprise Advanced**"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-guide.md:220
msgid ""
"An **RTCD Server** is added as a dedicated media service that processes "
"all call audio and screen sharing media."
msgstr ""
"**RTCD 서버**가 모든 통화 오디오 및 화면 공유 미디어를 처리하는 전용 미디어 서비스로 "
"추가됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-guide.md:222
msgid "Calls deployment with RTCD"
msgstr "RTCD를 사용한 통화 배포"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-guide.md:227
msgid ""
"The Mattermost server is still responsible for signaling (setting up, "
"managing, and ending calls) and channel state (who is joining or leaving,"
" who has muted, and overall call status), but the call media itself flows"
" directly between clients and the RTCD server, completely bypassing the "
"Mattermost server."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST 서버는 여전히 시그널링(통화 설정, 관리 및 종료)과 채널 상태(누가 참가하거나 "
"나가는지, 누가 음소거했는지, 전체 통화 상태)를 담당하지만, 통화 미디어 자체는 OKR.BEST "
"서버를 완전히 우회하여 클라이언트와 RTCD 서버 간에 직접 흐릅니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-guide.md:231
msgid ""
"Use RTCD if you need optimized performance, scalability, and the best "
"possible user experience for Mattermost Calls. Specifically:"
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST 통화(Calls)에 최적화된 성능, 확장성 및 최상의 사용자 경험이 필요한 경우 "
"RTCD를 사용하십시오. 구체적으로:"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-guide.md:233
msgid ""
"You want to keep call media traffic off your main Mattermost server to "
"improve overall server performance and reduce CPU usage spikes."
msgstr ""
"전반적인 서버 성능을 개선하고 CPU 사용량 급증을 줄이기 위해 통화 미디어 트래픽을 기본 "
"OKR.BEST 서버에서 분리하려는 경우."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-guide.md:234
msgid ""
"You need your deployment to easily scale as call volume increases; "
"additional RTCD servers can be added for load balancing."
msgstr ""
"통화량이 증가함에 따라 배포가 쉽게 확장되어야 하는 경우. 로드 밸런싱을 위해 추가 RTCD "
"서버를 추가할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-guide.md:235
msgid ""
"You want the lowest possible media latency and highest reliability for "
"Calls."
msgstr ""
"통화에 가능한 가장 낮은 미디어 지연 시간과 가장 높은 안정성을 원하는 경우."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-guide.md:236
msgid "You are deploying Mattermost on Kubernetes, where RTCD is required."
msgstr "RTCD가 필요한 Kubernetes에 OKR.BEST를 배포하는 경우."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-guide.md:241
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-guide.md:261
msgid ""
"**RTCD Server**: Dedicated media service. Clients connect to it directly "
"for media traffic."
msgstr ""
"**RTCD 서버**: 전용 미디어 서비스. 클라이언트는 미디어 트래픽을 위해 여기에 직접 "
"연결합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-guide.md:247
msgid ""
