"guide/configure/calls-deployment-guide.md:247: (INFO/1) Duplicate "
"implicit target name: \"recording\"."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-guide.md:249
msgid ""
"The **Recording** service (`calls-offloader`) can optionally be added to "
"an **RTCD** Calls deployment if you need to enable recording, "
"transcription, and live captions."
msgstr ""
"녹화, 전사 및 실시간 자막을 활성화해야 하는 경우 **녹화** 서비스(`calls-offloader`)를 "
"**RTCD** 통화 배포에 선택적으로 추가할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-guide.md:251
