#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-guide.md:523
msgid ""
"You have chosen your deployment architecture and provisioned the required"
" servers."
msgstr ""
"배포 아키텍처를 선택하고 필요한 서버를 프로비저닝했습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-guide.md:524
msgid ""
"You have confirmed your Mattermost license supports the architecture and "
"features you plan to deploy."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST 라이선스가 배포하려는 아키텍처 및 기능을 지원하는지 확인했습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-guide.md:525
msgid ""
"Every required firewall rule and network path for your chosen "
"architecture has been opened."
msgstr ""
"선택한 아키텍처에 필요한 모든 방화벽 규칙과 네트워크 경로가 열렸습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-guide.md:526
